  "deleteAccountConfirmBodyApple": "This cannot be undone. Deleting removes your sign-in, so you will no longer be able to sign in to this account.",
  "@deleteAccountConfirmBodyApple": {
    "description": "O-OAUTH-DELETE-REAUTH, owner-approved 2026-09-16. The delete confirmation body for a PASSWORD-LESS account (Sign in with Apple). Replaces deleteAccountConfirmBody, which names an email and password this account does not have. ⏱ 2026-09-26: owner-approved provider-free wording, O-REAUTH-COPY-NAMES-APPLE-ONLY (the lead's ruling PRE-1 of 2026-09-26 15:56Z, made under the owner's delegation of wording)."
