  "updateRequiredTitle": "Update required",
  "@updateRequiredTitle": {
    "description": "Heading on the force-update wall. THE WALL REPLACES THE WHOLE APP when the running version falls below the supported floor, so this is the only text on screen and there is no way past it. Until 2026-09-04 no key existed and ForceUpdateGate's English parameter default shipped to every locale."
